        "t": 632.5076629101563,
        "r": 541.3084799999995,
        "b": 607.436101363195
      },
      "content": "Confirm that all power distribution switches and internal power switches of UPS are cut off. Paste warning identification at the location of switches to prevent faulty operation of others.",
      "section_id": "sec_3_8_1",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3_8",
      "section_level": 3,
      "section_path": [
        {
