        "b": 498.206101363195
      },
      "content": "Note: When 200 ~ 300 kVA UPS is connected with rectifier input cable, the minimum distance between the fixed screw rod and protective cover should be 3 cm to prevent accidents caused by sparking or short circuit of cabinet due to the insufficient distance of safety regulation.",
